18:13.380 --> 18:16.950
reinitialize Jolly and
end the collect command.

18:16.950 --> 18:18.680
Anti-virus?

18:19.870 --> 18:20.780
Chopin-san!

18:21.370 --> 18:23.690
Maybe you can do something with Musik.

18:24.120 --> 18:24.880
Yeah.

18:25.220 --> 18:26.220
However...

18:26.850 --> 18:29.010
I fear that, if the virus is removed,

18:29.530 --> 18:31.790
Jolly will return to being
no more than an app,

18:32.070 --> 18:34.880
and will lose her current individuality.

18:36.390 --> 18:39.390
So Jolly can't be saved either way?

18:40.300 --> 18:41.890
I'm afraid not.

18:42.510 --> 18:44.390
N-No...

18:46.320 --> 18:47.300
I can't.

18:48.140 --> 18:50.220
I can't lose Jolly.

19:06.560 --> 19:07.760
Chopin.

19:11.940 --> 19:13.000
Too bad.

19:13.860 --> 19:17.860
I thought I'd become a top idol so I could

19:18.450 --> 19:22.340
make them understand how
amazing your music is.

19:24.390 --> 19:27.590
I love your music.

19:28.260 --> 19:31.010
The song we made together.

19:31.690 --> 19:34.700
I don't want some creep taking it.

19:35.110 --> 19:35.930
So...

19:36.930 --> 19:39.660
end it with your hands, Chopin.

19:43.360 --> 19:44.410
Jolly...

20:42.640 --> 20:44.710
Thank you, Chopin.

20:45.700 --> 20:46.690
Jolly...

20:47.570 --> 20:49.270
Is this goodbye?

20:50.420 --> 20:52.950
I had fun being with you.

20:53.610 --> 20:54.550
Me, too.

20:55.220 --> 20:58.160
Don't forget me.

20:59.790 --> 21:00.950
Don't go.

21:01.250 --> 21:02.370
Don't worry.

21:03.000 --> 21:06.970
I'll always be inside of you, singing.

21:08.630 --> 21:11.830
Hey, do you like my singing?

21:14.180 --> 21:16.530
Yeah, I do.

21:19.300 --> 21:20.960
Happy pickles.

21:22.890 --> 21:23.880
Chopin,

21:24.920 --> 21:26.050
goodbye.

21:27.640 --> 21:31.640
Enter a Name

21:30.010 --> 21:31.000
Jolly...

21:31.880 --> 21:35.490
I've lost you again.

21:37.150 --> 21:38.200
Again?

21:38.970 --> 21:40.450
George Sand.

21:40.770 --> 21:43.650
A French female novelist and feminist.

21:43.990 --> 21:47.200
She was said to be Frédéric
Chopin's companion

21:47.200 --> 21:49.280
during the prime of his musical career.

21:49.540 --> 21:50.740
George.

21:51.200 --> 21:52.220
Jolly.

21:52.800 --> 21:54.160
I see.

21:55.500 --> 21:57.760
I'm sorry.

21:58.060 --> 21:59.180
Cho-chan.

22:00.290 --> 22:02.890
Thanks, guys.

22:06.330 --> 22:10.330
Sample "Jolly" vanished in
the middle of analysis.

22:10.330 --> 22:11.760
The reason is unknown.

22:12.270 --> 22:14.550
But I would like to continue

22:14.550 --> 22:17.300
my research and find another sample...

22:16.520 --> 22:17.900
Fine.

22:21.030 --> 22:22.270
Understood.

22:23.180 --> 22:25.360
I'll cease distribution of Arkhedol.

22:27.920 --> 22:29.240
Hello,

22:29.660 --> 22:31.580
I'm Jolly 2.

22:31.580 --> 22:32.740
Nice to meet you.

22:32.980 --> 22:35.720
You're so cute, Jolly 2.

22:36.380 --> 22:38.000
You're so resilient.

22:38.000 --> 22:41.000
To be continued

24:10.970 --> 24:27.730
11: "At Least Do the Chores"

24:11.850 --> 24:14.580
There's yesterday, there's
today, and there's tomorrow.

24:14.930 --> 24:16.600
That's life.

24:16.600 --> 24:18.930
Here's the deal: It's
the chores that matter.

24:19.150 --> 24:21.000
And no, I don't mean putting out fires.

24:21.000 --> 24:23.350
I mean cooking, laundry, cleaning
and taking out the trash.

24:23.350 --> 24:26.300
If you can't do that, your
genius, your music, your art...

24:26.300 --> 24:27.730
None of it matters!
